{% $title %} refused: the position resolves to {% if $subject.name %}{% $subject.name %}, {% /if %}declared at {% $subject.file %}{% if $subject.at %}:{% position($subject.at) %}{% /if %} — an installed dependency, not this workspace. A patch editing a dependency must never be applied; pick the position of the workspace symbol you meant.
